  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular Economy Hotspot Event &#x2013; Private Sector Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to support South Africa in its transition to a circular economy by contributing to the Circular Economy Hotspot Event in Cape Town, in September 2024. The focus of this project lies within engaging the private sector via business-to-business (B2B) matchmaking, capacity building and fostering the collaboration with the public sector.</narrative>
  </description>
